  "notes": [
    "The catalog title explicitly expands GeoAI through Artificial Intelligence (AI) applications; this is not an unrelated substring match.",
    "Local requirement inventory: introductory choice 1 of 2; techniques 2 of 5; analysis 2 of 7; required capstone. Techniques range 6–8 credits and total 18–20 are preserved without flattening the range.",
